# Heavy/opt-in Scoop packages (Windows equivalent of the opt-in Brewfile
# toolchains) — installed only when DOTFILES_FULL_INSTALL=1 is set.
# Format: [bucket/]package — all from the default 'main' bucket
#
# Not listed: rustup. Scoop's rustup package hardcodes CARGO_HOME/RUSTUP_HOME
# to its own persist directory via the package manifest's env_set (re-applied
# on every scoop update), which fights our own declared values. Installed
# instead via scripts/install-rust.ps1 (rustup-init.exe directly, respecting
# our CARGO_HOME/RUSTUP_HOME), mirroring how scripts/install-rust.fish
# installs it on Unix via sh.rustup.rs.

main/nodejs
main/ghcup
main/go
